            <ArticleTitle>Eat Smart, Move More North Carolina: an obesity prevention movement.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>407-12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Eat Smart, Move More North Carolina was established in response to the state's rapidly worsening obesity epidemic. Since its inception in 2002, the Eat Smart, Move More North Carolina movement has grown to include more than 90 member organizations and has developed and disseminated North Carolina's plan to address obesity for 2007-2012 and 2013-2020.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
